s1","text":"| Upstream project | `Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios` |\n| Upstream version this port tracks | **"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"v1.1.2** (commit `b21fa0f`, 2026-09-29) |\n| Upstream license | **MIT** (Copyright © 2026 Donchitos) "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"— reused here |\n| This repository | `deepseek-harness-game-studios` (DSGS) **v0.2.3** |\n| Port strat"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"egy | Dual stack, one source: `.claude/` is the content source (upstream text, kept verbatim); `.dsh"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"/**` is generated by `tools/build-dsh.mjs` |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Upstream targets Claude Code (`.claude/`, `.sh` hooks, `bash` one-liners, `@path` imports). None of "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"that\nruns under DSH (no `bash` tool, piped child processes are denied by the sandbox, `@path` is not"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" expanded),\nso instead of editing upstream content we generate a DSH-runnable equivalent and prove *"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ead of editing upstream content we generate a DSH-runnable equivalent and prove **no content loss**."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> The plugin package bundles the framework under `payload/` — you never need to look at it while usi"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ackage bundles the framework under `payload/` — you never need to look at it while using the plugin."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### ① Web client"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"`Plugins` → `Add plugin` → paste `https://github.com/HYClub/deepseek-harness-game-studios` → **Insta"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ll** → restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### ② Desktop client"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open the desktop app, then `Plugins` → `Add plugin` → paste the same URL → **Install** → restart the"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"the desktop app, then `Plugins` → `Add plugin` → paste the same URL → **Install** → restart the app."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"On first load the plugin installs the framework at machine level (`~/.dsh/dsgs` plus user-level\nboot"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"strap skills). After that:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"`/start` checks whether the workspace is initialised; if not it initialises it first, then walks you"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"\nthrough onboarding."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Upgrade"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Run `/update` inside an initialised workspace (0.2.1 and later):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"It reads the installed version and the newest release, shows the commands it will run, and runs them"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" only after\nyou agree. Restart the client afterwards — the new skills appear in a new session."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Is this workspace initialised?** Yes when `.dsh/skills/start/SKILL.md` or `.dsgs-installed.json` e"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"xists in the\nproject root. If neither is there, open the project in DSH, start a new session and typ"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e `/start`: that\ninitialises it once, and every later session in the same project can use `/update`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Coming from 0.2.0 or earlier?** `/update` only exists from 0.2.1 on, so the first update is manual"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"*Coming from 0.2.0 or earlier?** `/update` only exists from 0.2.1 on, so the first update is manual:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Desktop app users do the same through `Plugins` (see below). Every update after that is one `/update"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"sktop app users do the same through `Plugins` (see below). Every update after that is one `/update`."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Desktop app** — the app owns its plugin profile, so the command line cannot change it. Open `Plugi"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ns`, uninstall\n`deepseek-harness-game-studios`, choose `Add plugin`, paste\n`https://github.com/HYClu"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"b/deepseek-harness-game-studios`, install, then restart the app. `/update` still reports\nthe version"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" and tells you when this is needed."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## What the plugin writes to your machine (and how to undo it)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Path | What |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `~/.dsh/dsgs/**` | framework payload (skills, agents, rules, hooks, tools, docs, instruction files"},{"id":"p31s2","text":") |\n| `~/.dsh/skills/dsgs-init/SKILL.md`, `~/.dsh/skills/start/SKILL.md` | user-level bootstrap skil"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"| `~/.dsh/skills/dsgs-init/SKILL.md`, `~/.dsh/skills/start/SKILL.md` | user-level bootstrap skills |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"It never touches a project directory and never overwrites project files. To undo:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Implementation status"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### ✅ Implemented (all measured)"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Item | Status | Notes |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Skills | ✅ | all 74 upstream skills ported, each invocable as `/name` |\n| Agent role cards | ✅ | 4"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"9, as `.dsh/agents/<name>.md` + delegation conventions |\n| Rules | ✅ | 13, including an equivalent f"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"or upstream's path-scoped rule engine: a PostToolUse hook injects the matching rule text after each "},{"id":"p37s4","text":"write/edit |\n| Hooks | ✅ | 13 upstream hook scripts → 14 Node implementations (one DSH-only addition"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"), bridged via `dsh-hooks-claude-code`; all 9 upstream events covered |\n| Hooks actually run | ✅ | m"},{"id":"p37s6","text":"ount 10/10 · protocol 12/12 · live events 6/9 — measured on a host where the official bridge package"},{"id":"p37s7","text":" is installed; elsewhere the checks report SKIP instead of a false failure |\n| Config resolution | ✅"},{"id":"p37s8","text":" | `project.yaml` single source; Node ports of `resolve_config` / `__call resolve_setting` |\n| Helpe"},{"id":"p37s9","text":"r scripts | ✅ | every upstream `.sh` has a Node port (`.dsh/scripts/*.mjs`) that runs inside the san"},{"id":"p37s10","text":"dbox |\n| Content fidelity | ✅ | 258 files / 42,895 lines: 96.0% verbatim, 3.1% documented rewrites, "},{"id":"p37s11","text":"0.5% structural, 0.4% fuzzy, **0 unexplained loss** |\n| Machine-level install | ✅ | the plugin ships"},{"id":"p37s12","text":" the payload (924 files) and installs it on first load; `/start` then initialises an empty workspace"},{"id":"p37s13","text":" from it |\n| `/statusline` | ✅ | studio status line `stage · posture · epic > story · Sprint n/m · e"},{"id":"p37s14","text":"ngine` (+13 unit tests) |\n| Nested delegation | ✅ | `subagent.maxDepth: 2` — parent → child → grandc"},{"id":"p37s15","text":"hild verified (DSH default is 1) |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
